+// (Arm's Mali driver). Adapted from The Simpsons Game recomp on ReXGlue
+// (github.com/YesterMester/TheSimpsonsGameRecomp, GPL-3.0), IssueVertexMemExportCompute, with the
+// plain shared memory paths only (no native vertex streams or separate memory export buffer). The
+// translator's kMemExportCompute mode runs one invocation per guest processing index
+// (gl_GlobalInvocationID.x + y * kMemExportComputeDispatchX, below
+// compute_memexport_vertex_count), loads the guest DMA index from the shared memory at
